-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentRatingKey="6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Pecado de Amor" grandparentType="show" index="12" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 12" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 12" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1784257200" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784260800" id="6a503eabd2685cfa012da7d7" live="0" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1784278800" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784282400" id="6a503eabd2685cfa012da7dd" live="0" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1784300400" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784304000" id="6a503eabd2685cfa012da7e3" live="0" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1784322000" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784325600" id="6a503eabd2685cfa012da7e9" live="0" onAir="0" prem